{
  "name": "Master Scrivener",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The gold and time you must spend to make a spell scroll are halved if you use your Wizardly Quill.</p><p>Whenever you finish a Long Rest, you can create one or more spell scrolls with a combined spell level of no more than your Proficiency. You do not have to make a skill check or provide any spell slots, gold, or time for these scrolls and the resulting scrolls automatically have the masterwork property. All other rules for creating spell scrolls apply normally.</p>",
